  "goodToKnow": "Unterbinden means to put a stop to or prevent: Missbrauch unterbinden, den Handel unterbinden, Versuche unterbinden. In medicine, it means to tie off (ligate) a blood vessel. It's formal; everyday alternatives are stoppen and verhindern. Not separable, irregular like binden: unterband, unterbunden. Don't confuse it with verbinden (to connect, bandage)."
